{"version":1,"content":"<p>廉政公署落案起訴一名港交所前副總裁，控告他涉嫌不誠實地取用港交所的內部資訊系統，當中涉及上市公司的機密資料。</p><p>被告母親則涉及相關公司的股票交易，同被起訴。</p><p>案件今午在東區裁判法院提訊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:46:09.935104+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T05:26:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:30.029228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:38:39.881493+00:00","content_hash":"3e92e6bdc1da5fa8043ef0e1de3febc663ce7072d08c2271681997f06598998a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}